{"id":82,"title":"അവസാന മിനിറ്റിലെ ഗോളിൽ കൊച്ചിക്ക് ആവേശ ജയം","subheadline":"സീസണിലെ ആദ്യ ഹോം മത്സരത്തിൽ നിറഞ്ഞ ഗാലറിക്ക് മുന്നിൽ വിജയം","url":"/football/avasana-minirrile-golil-kochchikk-avesha-jayam","full_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/football/avasana-minirrile-golil-kochchikk-avesha-jayam","image":{"id":141,"alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"thumbnail":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-25.2e16d0ba.fill-400x225.format-webp.webp","width":400,"height":225},"card":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-25.2e16d0ba.fill-800x450.format-webp.webp","width":800,"height":450}},"primary_category":{"id":24,"name":"Football","slug":"football","colour":"#D84315","url":"/football"},"reporter":{"name":"Rahul Nair","slug":"rahul-nair","url":"/reporter/rahul-nair"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:02:39.888157+05:30","last_major_update_at":null,"reading_time":1,"language":"ml","flags":{"is_breaking":false,"is_premium":false,"has_video":true},"hero_image":{"id":141,"alt":"Illustrative stock photo","width":1600,"height":900,"hero":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-25.2e16d0ba.fill-1600x900.format-webp.webp","width":1600,"height":900},"card":{"url":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-picsum-25.2e16d0ba.fill-800x450.format-webp.webp","width":800,"height":450}},"featured_image_caption":"","featured_image_credit":"Alejandro Escamilla (Picsum #25)","body":[{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>അവസാന മിനിറ്റിൽ നേടിയ ഗോളിലൂടെ കൊച്ചി ടീം സീസണിലെ ആദ്യ ഹോം മത്സരത്തിൽ ജയം സ്വന്തമാക്കി. നിറഞ്ഞ ഗാലറിയുടെ മുന്നിലായിരുന്നു മത്സരം.</p>","id":"d51d9f0e-5cfc-46ab-9a09-ec1127d8ca36"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>ആദ്യ പകുതിയിൽ ഇരു ടീമുകളും ഗോൾ നേടാനാകാതെ പിരിഞ്ഞു. രണ്ടാം പകുതിയിൽ ആക്രമണം ശക്തമാക്കിയ ആതിഥേയർ നിരവധി അവസരങ്ങൾ സൃഷ്ടിച്ചു.</p>","id":"5927ebcc-b905-4608-90b2-63906b6a679a"},{"type":"paragraph","value":"<p>അടുത്ത ആഴ്ച എവേ മത്സരത്തിനായി ടീം യാത്ര തിരിക്കും. പരിക്കേറ്റ രണ്ട് താരങ്ങൾ തിരിച്ചെത്തുമെന്നാണ് പ്രതീക്ഷ.</p>","id":"25ff3b99-fcf4-4aa7-8f78-5bd0a9e85c1c"},{"type":"video_embed","value":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqz-KE-bpKQ","caption":""},"id":"c7a010e7-d907-441f-b4e6-8e8dc8dce19b"}],"live_updates":[],"corrections":[],"reporter_profile":{"name":"Rahul Nair","slug":"rahul-nair","url":"/reporter/rahul-nair","designation":"Correspondent","beat":"Sports and Business, Kochi","bio":"Rahul reports on sports and business from Kochi, with a focus on football and start-ups.","photo":null,"social":{"x":null,"facebook":null,"instagram":null,"linkedin":null}},"categories":[{"id":24,"name":"Football","slug":"football","colour":"#D84315","url":"/football"},{"id":9,"name":"Sports","slug":"sports","colour":"#D84315","url":"/sports"}],"tags":[{"name":"football","slug":"football","url":"/tag/football"}],"location":"","district":"","is_featured":false,"is_editors_pick":false,"is_premium":false,"premium_gate_ready":false,"allow_ads":true,"word_count":43,"updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:32:07.779592+05:30","breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Home","url":"/"},{"name":"Sports","url":"/sports"},{"name":"Football","url":"/football"},{"name":"അവസാന മിനിറ്റിലെ ഗോളിൽ കൊച്ചിക്ക് ആവേശ ജയം","url":"/football/avasana-minirrile-golil-kochchikk-avesha-jayam"}],"seo":{"title":"അവസാന മിനിറ്റിലെ ഗോളിൽ കൊച്ചിക്ക് ആവേശ ജയം","description":"സീസണിലെ ആദ്യ ഹോം മത്സരത്തിൽ നിറഞ്ഞ ഗാലറിക്ക് മുന്നിൽ വിജയം","og_image":"__PREVIEW_MEDIA__/images/stock-_a7GAHFl.2e16d0ba.fill-1200x630.format-jpeg.jpegquality-85.jpg","canonical_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/football/avasana-minirrile-golil-kochchikk-avesha-jayam","noindex":false,"published_time":"2026-11-17T16:02:39.888157+05:30","modified_time":"2026-11-19T09:32:07.779592+05:30"},"alternate_version":null,"related":[{"id":50,"title":"Highlights: Kerala Blasters' late winner seals the derby","subheadline":"Watch the goals and the post-match reactions from Kochi","url":"/football/highlights-kerala-blasters-late-winner-seals-the-derby","full_url":"__PREVIEW_SITE__/football/highlights-kerala-blasters-late-winner-seals-the-derby","